          "snippet": {
            "text": "theorem integral_g2 {y : ℝ} (hy : 0 < y) :\n    ∫ u in (1 / 2 : ℝ)..1, g2 (u * y) =\n      ∑ r₁ ∈ Icc 1 ⌊y⌋₊, ∑ r₂ ∈ Icc 1 ⌊y⌋₊,\n        (if Nat.Coprime r₁ r₂ ∧ Odd (r₁ * r₂) then\n          (μ r₁ : ℝ) * μ r₂ / ((σ 1 r₁ : ℝ) * σ 1 r₂) else 0) * wM y r₁ r₂ :=",
